# Steamvent Harbour (CIPlay steamvent_harbour): the quay, the notice, the machete's plans, the greenhouse vines, the
# gardener's log, the boiler house, the rats in the pipe store, the vent valve (steam), the town hall locker, the minutes.
island Steamvent Harbour
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Warm Harbour
expect hidden steamhouses
zone quay
expect step 1
read Harbour master's notice
expect step 2
open Harbour store
wait 3
expect step 3
expect item Machete 1
use greenvines
expect hidden greenvines
zone greenhouse
expect step 4
open Greenhouse store
expect item Seed_Banana 2
read Gardener's log
expect step 5
open Boiler house
wait 3
expect step 6
open Steam-house locker
expect message frozen
zone pipestore
kill Rat
expect step 7
open Pipe store
wait 3
expect step 8
use ventvalve
expect story steam 1
expect shown steamhouses
expect step 9
use ventvalve
expect message is open
open Steam-house locker
wait 3
expect step 10
read Town meeting minutes
expect done
